## 📈 Performance & Intelligence

The bot doesn't just blindly trade. Before every decision, it considers:

| What It Checks | Why It Matters |
|---|---|
| **RSI** (Relative Strength Index) | Tells if a stock is oversold (cheap) or overbought (expensive) |
| **MACD** (Moving Average Trend) | Shows if a stock's momentum is going up or down |
| **ADX** (Trend Strength) | Measures how strong the current trend is |
| **ATR** (Volatility) | Measures how wildly a stock's price is swinging |
| **Nifty 50 Overall Trend** | Checks if the overall market is going up or down |
| **India VIX** (Fear Index) | Gauges how nervous or calm the market is |

All of this happens behind the scenes — you just see the simple result: **BUY**, **SELL**, or **WAIT**.

